## Test / coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

## OS noise
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

## Local secrets / user config — never commit
*.env
.env.*
appsettings.*.Local.json
# The pattern above does not match the usual appsettings.Local.json filename.
appsettings.Local.json

## Local agent scratch (never committed): briefs, review diffs, local specs/plans
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/

## Claude Code local settings (CLAUDE.md is committed)
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

## Git worktrees
.worktrees/

## Editor, merge, and local-run leftovers outside bin/obj
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
~$*

## WPF markup compile leaves these beside the csproj if a build is killed
*.tmp_proj
*_wpftmp.csproj

## Test and coverage files that can land outside TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## Crash dumps from a desktop run or debugger
*.dmp
*.mdmp

## Private certificates and secret-shaped filenames
*.pfx
*.p12
secrets.json

## ReSharper caches (*.DotSettings.user is already matched by *.user)
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper

## Local history, and Rider's solution file (.idea/ is already ignored)
.history/
.localhistory/
.vshistory/
*.sln.iml
